Relevant tables & columns  

bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.tlc_yellow_trips_2016  
• `pickup_datetime`: filter pick‑up time (July 1‑7 2016)  
• `dropoff_datetime`: filter drop‑off time (same date window & strictly > pick‑up)  
• `passenger_count`: keep trips with more than 5 riders  
• `trip_distance`: keep trips ≥ 10 miles  
• `fare_amount`, `tip_amount`, `tolls_amount`, `mta_tax`, `total_amount`: must all be ≥ 0 to rule‑out negative values  
• `pickup_location_id`, `dropoff_location_id`: join keys to the taxi‑zone table  

bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.taxi_zone_geom  
• `zone_id`: join key  
• `zone_name`: readable zone description (pickup & drop‑off)  

Typical additional conditions  
• `dropoff_datetime` > `pickup_datetime`  
• Compute duration (seconds): `TIMESTAMP_DIFF(dropoff_datetime , pickup_datetime , SECOND)`  
• Compute speed (mph): `trip_distance / (duration_sec / 3600)`  
• Compute tip‑rate (%): `100*tip_amount / NULLIF(total_amount,0)`  

Below are ten exploratory → final SQL snippets (all limited to 20 rows except the last).  
Each illustrates a different step; copy‑paste into the BigQuery console to inspect results.

```sql
--1. Quick look at 2016 yellow trip rows
SELECT *
FROM `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.tlc_yellow_trips_2016`
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--2. How many trips were recorded between 1‑Jul‑2016 and 7‑Jul‑2016 inclusive?
SELECT COUNT(*) AS trip_cnt
FROM `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.tlc_yellow_trips_2016`
WHERE pickup_datetime BETWEEN '2016-07-01' AND '2016-07-07 23:59:59'
  AND dropoff_datetime BETWEEN '2016-07-01' AND '2016-07-07 23:59:59';
```

```sql
--3. Add passenger and distance filters
SELECT COUNT(*) AS qualified_cnt
FROM `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.tlc_yellow_trips_2016`
WHERE pickup_datetime BETWEEN '2016-07-01' AND '2016-07-07 23:59:59'
  AND dropoff_datetime BETWEEN '2016-07-01' AND '2016-07-07 23:59:59'
  AND passenger_count > 5
  AND trip_distance >= 10;
```

```sql
--4. Check for any negative fare‑related values within our date window
SELECT *
FROM `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.tlc_yellow_trips_2016`
WHERE pickup_datetime BETWEEN '2016-07-01' AND '2016-07-07 23:59:59'
  AND (fare_amount  < 0 OR tip_amount < 0 OR tolls_amount < 0 
       OR mta_tax   < 0 OR total_amount < 0)
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--5. Make sure drop‑off occurs after pick‑up
SELECT *
FROM `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.tlc_yellow_trips_2016`
WHERE pickup_datetime BETWEEN '2016-07-01' AND '2016-07-07 23:59:59'
  AND dropoff_datetime < pickup_datetime
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--6. Compute raw duration (seconds) & average speed (mph) for candidate trips
SELECT
  pickup_datetime,
  dropoff_datetime,
  TIMESTAMP_DIFF(dropoff_datetime,pickup_datetime,SECOND) AS duration_sec,
  trip_distance,
  trip_distance / (TIMESTAMP_DIFF(dropoff_datetime,pickup_datetime,SECOND)/3600.0) AS mph
FROM `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.tlc_yellow_trips_2016`
WHERE pickup_datetime BETWEEN '2016-07-01' AND '2016-07-07 23:59:59'
  AND dropoff_datetime BETWEEN '2016-07-01' AND '2016-07-07 23:59:59'
  AND passenger_count > 5
  AND trip_distance >= 10
  AND fare_amount >= 0 AND tip_amount >= 0 AND tolls_amount >= 0
  AND mta_tax    >= 0 AND total_amount >= 0
  AND dropoff_datetime > pickup_datetime
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--7. Attach pickup zone names
SELECT
  z.zone_name AS pickup_zone,
  COUNT(*)    AS trips_from_zone
FROM `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.tlc_yellow_trips_2016` AS t
JOIN `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.taxi_zone_geom`          AS z
  ON t.pickup_location_id = z.zone_id
WHERE pickup_datetime BETWEEN '2016-07-01' AND '2016-07-07 23:59:59'
GROUP BY pickup_zone
ORDER BY trips_from_zone DESC
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--8. Attach BOTH pickup & dropoff zones for candidate trips
SELECT
  p.zone_name AS pickup_zone,
  d.zone_name AS dropoff_zone,
  COUNT(*)    AS trip_cnt
FROM `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.tlc_yellow_trips_2016` AS t
JOIN `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.taxi_zone_geom` AS p
  ON t.pickup_location_id = p.zone_id
JOIN `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.taxi_zone_geom` AS d
  ON t.dropoff_location_id = d.zone_id
WHERE pickup_datetime BETWEEN '2016-07-01' AND '2016-07-07 23:59:59'
  AND passenger_count > 5
  AND trip_distance >= 10
  AND dropoff_datetime > pickup_datetime
  AND fare_amount >= 0 AND tip_amount >= 0 AND tolls_amount >= 0
  AND mta_tax    >= 0 AND total_amount >= 0
GROUP BY pickup_zone, dropoff_zone
ORDER BY trip_cnt DESC
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--9. Preview tip‑rate %
SELECT
  tip_amount,
  total_amount,
  ROUND(100*tip_amount / NULLIF(total_amount,0),2) AS tip_pct
FROM `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.tlc_yellow_trips_2016`
WHERE pickup_datetime BETWEEN '2016-07-01' AND '2016-07-07 23:59:59'
  AND passenger_count > 5
  AND trip_distance >= 10
  AND dropoff_datetime > pickup_datetime
  AND fare_amount >= 0 AND tip_amount >= 0 AND tolls_amount >= 0
  AND mta_tax    >= 0 AND total_amount >= 0
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--10. FINAL ANSWER: top 10 qualifying trips sorted by total fare
SELECT
  p.zone_name                                                    AS pickup_zone,
  d.zone_name                                                    AS dropoff_zone,
  TIMESTAMP_DIFF(dropoff_datetime, pickup_datetime , SECOND)     AS trip_duration_sec,
  ROUND( trip_distance / (TIMESTAMP_DIFF(dropoff_datetime, pickup_datetime, SECOND)/3600.0)
        ,2)                                                      AS avg_mph,
  ROUND( 100*tip_amount / NULLIF(total_amount,0) ,2)             AS tip_rate_pct,
  total_amount                                                   AS total_fare
FROM `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.tlc_yellow_trips_2016` AS t
JOIN `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.taxi_zone_geom`        AS p
  ON t.pickup_location_id = p.zone_id
JOIN `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.taxi_zone_geom`        AS d
  ON t.dropoff_location_id = d.zone_id
WHERE pickup_datetime BETWEEN '2016-07-01' AND '2016-07-07 23:59:59'
  AND dropoff_datetime BETWEEN '2016-07-01' AND '2016-07-07 23:59:59'
  AND passenger_count > 5
  AND trip_distance  >= 10
  AND fare_amount  >= 0 AND tip_amount  >= 0 AND tolls_amount >= 0
  AND mta_tax      >= 0 AND total_amount >= 0
  AND dropoff_datetime > pickup_datetime
ORDER BY total_fare DESC
LIMIT 10;
```

